---
title: Start graph · one service node
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> observing : up begins
  observing --> kept : label, boot and state agree
  observing --> resumed : created, never started
  observing --> planned : spec changed or missing
  observing --> retiring : not in the plan
  kept --> started : still warming
  kept --> ready : list or probe says ready
  kept --> done : ready and routed already
  resumed --> starting : wave start saved
  planned --> unpublishing : old route live
  planned --> intent : wave intent saved
  unpublishing --> intent : slots released
  intent --> removing : old generation exists
  intent --> creating : no old generation
  removing --> creating : old generation gone
  creating --> created : reply with id
  creating --> unsure : reply lost
  unsure --> created : inspect finds it
  unsure --> planned : inspect finds none
  created --> starting : deps ready, W2 saved
  created --> blocked : dependency failed
  starting --> started : W3 saved
  starting --> unsure_start : start reply lost
  unsure_start --> started : list says running
  unsure_start --> failed : list says exited
  started --> ready : list or probe says ready
  started --> failed : exited or unhealthy
  ready --> publishing : ready set batched
  ready --> done : not routed
  publishing --> published : fence holds
  publishing --> started : fence saw a change
  published --> done : batch complete
  retiring --> done : removed
  done --> [*] : up done
  failed --> [*] : retained for cleanup
  blocked --> [*] : retained for cleanup
  note right of intent
    INV NoEffectWithoutIntent
    one save per wave
  end note
  note right of unsure
    Rule 3: inspect by name
    before any retry
  end note
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px
  class creating,starting,publishing live
  class kept,published,done ok
  class unsure,unsure_start wait
  class failed,blocked fail
